" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"ΓιΠριιγμομγένης\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"ΓιΠριιγμομγένης\">&lt;Π&gt;ρι&lt;μ&gt;ο&lt;γ&gt;ένης\u003C/span>\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐτελεύτη\n                    σεν\">ἐτελεύτη-\u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>σεν\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"ζήσας\">ζήσας\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al4-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἔτη\">ἔτη\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">ο\u003C/span>´ \u003Cspan data-text=\"καὶ\">καὶ\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐν\n                    θάδε\">ἐν-\u003Cbr id=\"al5-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">5\u003C/span>θάδε\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"κῖται\">κῖται\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al6-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">6\u003C/span>(Χριστό)ς \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">l.1 Π | μ | γ\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"ΓιΠριιγμομγένης\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"ΓιΠριιγμομγένης\">ΓΙΡΙΙΓΟΜΕΝΗΣ\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐτελεύτη\n                    σεν\">ΕΤΕΛΕΥΤΗ\u003Cbr id=\"al3-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>ΣΕΝ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ζήσας\">ΖΗΣΑΣ\u003C/span>\u003Cbr id=\"al4-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἔτη\">ΕΤΗ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">Ο\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"καὶ\">ΚΑΙ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐν\n                    θάδε\">ΕΝ\u003Cbr id=\"al5-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">5\u003C/span>ΘΑΔΕ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"κῖται\">ΚΙΤΑΙ\u003C/span>\u003Cbr id=\"al6-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">6\u003C/span>☧Σ\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">l.1 Π | μ | γ\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"facsimile-images\">\u003Ch2>Facsimile Images\u003C/h2>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"apparatus\">\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>\u003Cspan>Text after Le Blant and IG\u003C/span>\u003C/span>; \u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"line 1\">line.1: \u003Cspan>l. 1 ριοένη IG XIV 546; ριομένη CIG IV 9490; ΓΙΡΙΓΟΜΕΝΗΣ Amico, Ferrara, Le Blant\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"translation\">\u003Ch2>English translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">\u003Ca href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163\">Marta Fogagnolo\u003C/a>\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>Primogenes died at the age of 50 and lies here.\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"commentary\">\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>The inscription is Christian, as indicated by the Christogram in l. 6. For the name \u003Cspan class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Πριμογένης\u003C/span> (with μ and γ transposed) in Sicily, see IGCVO 1339 (Syracuse, a Christian inscription).\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"bibliography\">\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> Amico 1741 267 no. X \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002186\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002186\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Ferrara 1829 368 no. 3 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002005\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002005\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Le Blant 1856 xxxviii n.4 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001398\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001398\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Kirchhoff 1877 9490 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001249\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001249\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Kaibel 1890 \u003Ca href=\"https://clio.columbia.edu/catalog/6873760\" target=\"_blank\">546\u003C/a>  \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"handnote\">\u003Cp>lunate sigma and epsilon\u003C/p> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    \u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence \u003C/div>",[226,229,232,235,238,241],{"id":227,"html":228},"editions","\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"ΓιΠριιγμομγένης\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"ΓιΠριιγμομγένης\">&lt;Π&gt;ρι&lt;μ&gt;ο&lt;γ&gt;ένης\u003C/span>\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐτελεύτη\n                    σεν\">ἐτελεύτη-\u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>σεν\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"ζήσας\">ζήσας\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al4-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἔτη\">ἔτη\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">ο\u003C/span>´ \u003Cspan data-text=\"καὶ\">καὶ\u003C/span>  \u00